  "residual": "The verified claims identify Enugu Rangers as a Nigerian club founded in 1970, note that Rangers signed 13 players before the 2022/23 NPFL season, and indicate league success in 1982. However, they do not establish that the team described in the question is Enugu Rangers. The key season-specific facts remain unverified: a league season between 2011 and 2016, three instances of teams sharing the same points, a 6th–12th place finish with shared points, and a goal difference of 6–12. The claims also do not verify that Enugu is the capital city referred to or that a 2023 article stated the team had won fifteen trophies. Therefore the founding year and country of the team in the question cannot be conclusively determined from the verified claims."
}

